{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If I knew things were going to end up like this, I would've just apologized in the first place\u2026&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your best friend's birthday\u2014but after a recent fight with her, you're not exactly on speaking terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857590/extras/ffd7c917cbbaf092f0c82bee9da024c4.avif?t=1768716197\" width=600 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you even have a chance to wallow in regret, though, a burst of light erupts from your computer screen and sucks you into an alternate dimension\u2014where a rather snarky mouse gives you the rundown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rogue cat with a bad attitude has been leaping between realities and causing all sorts of dimensional mayhem\u2014and if something isn't done to stop it, it might very well cause another big bang. And you DEFINITELY don't want that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857590/extras/20a579c11d463530bdc863db3a12782b.avif?t=1768716197\" width=600 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no other options available, you set off in pursuit of the feisty feline\u2014not just to restore balance to the dimensions, but because it's the only way you'll ever make it back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this short-but-sweet adventure, you'll journey through the many worlds of Odencat games like Bear's Restaurant and Meg's Monster, meeting dozens of familiar friends along the way on your search for the runaway cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857590/extras/c79c5ddab6cd6f380aac5a3c3e80f2fa.avif?t=1768716197\" width=600 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did it throw the dimensions out of whack? What is it this little kitty-cat truly desires? And when all is said and done\u2014what will YOU wish for?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good Samaritan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857590/df51ee5e55ece5ac6f461c8981551705d49737ae.jpg"},{"name":"Booted It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857590/e48ba6f92657d4b103560202e2ed61dbe6d9786a.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Fisherman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857590/f7af97436763d65e8579c0481019bfe31d692df3.jpg"},{"name":"Tuna Thief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857590/1f64b432787facf2feebfc1756e0d84b218c455e.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857590/002b5ca3be8f734a762bdf4961cb7c1e8dec59d0.jpg"},{"name":"Happy Birthday!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857590/1700c8a18826e168ba315574c3a594da82d14bff.jpg"},{"name":"Kelly's Best Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857590/4fdb7968448d006abd193d19ebf226d7a6be2aaf.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857590?t=1768716197","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857590/b56825bafada3f0cd819d9a432f5004d0f35b931/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768716197","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857590/d2782ab7324219cca67b2ec20be2fa93f2312a5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768716197","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857590/d2782ab7324219cca67b2ec20be2fa93f2312a5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768716197","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","i